# Frontend and Styling

- Keep mobile CSS current and tested.
- Do not use raw inline styles. All styling must live in CSS files or the project's established styling system.
- If a style is reused more than once, move it to a shared/global CSS pattern.
- Keep CSS DRY, consistent, and organized.
- Remove unused styles.
